  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25146654",
      "title": "Creating \"Wrapper\" Components",
      "lectureOrder": 71,
      "videoOrder": 66,
      "sourceHash": "f164357832fe4bde9543c06ab33e2d87415793b13c5b6e344c036df242dc1b1a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.5,
          "end": 5.08,
          "en": "Now, let's start with that card look.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.08,
          "end": 6.393,
          "en": "In case, it's not clear what I mean,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.393,
          "end": 8.947,
          "en": "I mean that look, which we all used earlier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.947,
          "end": 11.31,
          "en": "for the first demo project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.31,
          "end": 13.95,
          "en": "where we simply have a nice white background",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.95,
          "end": 15.385,
          "en": "and a slight drop shadow.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.385,
          "end": 18.86,
          "en": "And I'd like to have that for every meetup item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.86,
          "end": 22.16,
          "en": "Now, we can solve this by adding a couple of CSS classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.16,
          "end": 25.072,
          "en": "in the meetup item module CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.072,
          "end": 28.06,
          "en": "and then changing the look of our list item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.06,
          "end": 29.5,
          "en": "that would work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.5,
          "end": 31.93,
          "en": "But this card look is so common",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.93,
          "end": 33.86,
          "en": "that we may also want to use it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.86,
          "end": 37.132,
          "en": "in our components of this application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.132,
          "end": 40.99,
          "en": "And we will actually use it in our components later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.99,
          "end": 44.644,
          "en": "That's why I want to create a separate reusable component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.644,
          "end": 49.607,
          "en": "which should act as a wrapper around our components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.607,
          "end": 52.67,
          "en": "and just give those components some styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.67,
          "end": 54.19,
          "en": "which we then reuse.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.19,
          "end": 56.55,
          "en": "And for this in the components folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.55,
          "end": 60.21,
          "en": "I'll add a new sub folder, which I just want to name UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.34,
          "end": 65.211,
          "en": "for user interface. The name is up to you, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.211,
          "end": 66.07,
          "en": "In there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.07,
          "end": 69.20400000000001,
          "en": "I want to store some general user interface components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.20400000000001,
          "end": 71.94,
          "en": "which don't belong to a specific feature,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.94,
          "end": 75.91,
          "en": "but instead are used in different places of the app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.91,
          "end": 78.37,
          "en": "And here, I'll add a card JS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.37,
          "end": 82.983,
          "en": "and attached you find a card module CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.075,
          "end": 88.083,
          "en": "which you can simply add next to this card JS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.15,
          "end": 90.76,
          "en": "And then the car JS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.76,
          "end": 93.37299999999999,
          "en": "we'll now create a component as we did it before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.37299999999999,
          "end": 97.238,
          "en": "simple functional component and export it of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.238,
          "end": 100.425,
          "en": "And we'll also import the styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.425,
          "end": 105.277,
          "en": "import classes from \"./card.module CSS.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.27000000000001,
          "end": 110.67,
          "en": "And then in the component function, return a simple div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.67,
          "end": 114.42099999999999,
          "en": "where we set the class name to classes.card.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.42099999999999,
          "end": 117.872,
          "en": "Now, the special thing about this component is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.872,
          "end": 121.272,
          "en": "that this should now be the first custom component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.272,
          "end": 126.203,
          "en": "which we can wrap around JSX content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.14,
          "end": 130.47,
          "en": "Because the goal is to use this card components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.47,
          "end": 135.3,
          "en": "such that on a meetup item, inside of this list item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.3,
          "end": 137.81,
          "en": "we can use card.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.81,
          "end": 141.44,
          "en": "And for this you need to add the import,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.44,
          "end": 146.11,
          "en": "so import card from going up one level diving into UI card.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 147.52,
          "end": 151.72,
          "en": "And we can wrap card around that JSX content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 152.99,
          "end": 155.35,
          "en": "so that we can use the card component like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 155.35,
          "end": 156.93,
          "en": "That's the goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 156.93,
          "end": 159.51,
          "en": "But at the moment, if you save all files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 159.51,
          "end": 161.883,
          "en": "the result is that you don't see anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 162.75,
          "end": 164.84,
          "en": "And the reason is that at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 164.84,
          "end": 169.84,
          "en": "this card component simply swallows everything we wrap",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 169.855,
          "end": 172.57999999999998,
          "en": "and throws it away, you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 172.57999999999998,
          "end": 176.24,
          "en": "Because this card component just renders a div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 176.24,
          "end": 178.02,
          "en": "and it doesn't know what it should do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 178.02,
          "end": 179.833,
          "en": "with any wrapped content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 180.78,
          "end": 182.9,
          "en": "Now, it's such a common case, though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 182.9,
          "end": 183.927,
          "en": "that you build components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 183.927,
          "end": 188.21,
          "en": "that should wrap itself around more JSX content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 188.21,
          "end": 191.654,
          "en": "So you could say that you want to inject JSX content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 191.654,
          "end": 193.29,
          "en": "into this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 193.29,
          "end": 197.8,
          "en": "That react, of course has a solution for this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 197.8,
          "end": 201.32999999999998,
          "en": "And this solution, again, is related to props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 201.32999999999998,
          "end": 203.46,
          "en": "We learned that we can pass props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 203.46,
          "end": 207.667,
          "en": "by adding attributes to an element, and that does work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 207.667,
          "end": 210.096,
          "en": "But you can also add a special prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 210.096,
          "end": 214.743,
          "en": "by passing content between the opening and closing text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 215.63,
          "end": 219.44,
          "en": "And that content is then exposed under that special prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 219.44,
          "end": 222.801,
          "en": "inside of that wrapping component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 222.801,
          "end": 226.49,
          "en": "So here we accept the props parameter again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 226.49,
          "end": 228.44,
          "en": "And then between the div text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 228.44,
          "end": 232.203,
          "en": "I want to output props.children.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 237.02,
          "end": 238.918,
          "en": "The children prop is a special prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 238.918,
          "end": 242.7,
          "en": "which every component receives by default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 242.7,
          "end": 245.62,
          "en": "And children always holds the content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 245.62,
          "end": 248.24,
          "en": "which is passed between the opening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 248.24,
          "end": 250.23,
          "en": "and closing component text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 250.23,
          "end": 251.776,
          "en": "So this JSX content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 251.776,
          "end": 256.776,
          "en": "that is the value stored in that children prop in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 257.2,
          "end": 260.403,
          "en": "when we use card in this component like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 261.66,
          "end": 265.49,
          "en": "And now I'm just outputting the value stored in children",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 265.49,
          "end": 267.75,
          "en": "between these div text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 267.75,
          "end": 270.132,
          "en": "And with that if we reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 270.132,
          "end": 272.69,
          "en": "we now have this slight card look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 272.69,
          "end": 275.11,
          "en": "and we see a drop shadow here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 275.11,
          "end": 276.83,
          "en": "Since we take up too much width,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 276.83,
          "end": 280.42,
          "en": "we don't see it perfectly, but we can see it a bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 280.42,
          "end": 283.5,
          "en": "And if we inspect this in the div tools,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 283.5,
          "end": 285.88,
          "en": "we see that every meetup item here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 286.89,
          "end": 290.63,
          "en": "has this div with the card class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 290.63,
          "end": 294.084,
          "en": "The name was transformed because of that CSS modules feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 294.084,
          "end": 296.72,
          "en": "but it has that div with a card class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 296.72,
          "end": 300.567,
          "en": "wrapped around these other divs image content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 300.567,
          "end": 303.623,
          "en": "and actions inside of the list item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 305.12,
          "end": 307.09,
          "en": "So that wrapping works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 307.09,
          "end": 310.3,
          "en": "and that is another very important technique",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 310.3,
          "end": 313.5,
          "en": "when it comes to composing user interfaces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 313.5,
          "end": 315.32,
          "en": "with react components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 315.32,
          "end": 318.41,
          "en": "and that's why we also cover it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 318.41,
          "end": 320.881,
          "en": "And we can now use this technique as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 320.881,
          "end": 325.51,
          "en": "for setting up a general layout for this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 326.78,
          "end": 330.052,
          "en": "because I'd like to have more white space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 330.052,
          "end": 332.52,
          "en": "around the content here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 332.52,
          "end": 335.23,
          "en": "And for this, I'll go to the layout folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 335.23,
          "end": 338.15,
          "en": "and add a layout component in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 338.15,
          "end": 341.397,
          "en": "Attached you also find a layout module CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 341.397,
          "end": 345.22,
          "en": "which you can add next to this JavaScript file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 345.22,
          "end": 347.77,
          "en": "And then here in layout JS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 347.77,
          "end": 352.27,
          "en": "we can create a layout component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 352.27,
          "end": 354.953,
          "en": "and export it as a default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 356.44,
          "end": 361.44,
          "en": "And import classes here from \"./layout.module.css,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 364.29,
          "end": 368.4,
          "en": "and then in here, return our layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 368.4,
          "end": 373.38,
          "en": "And that could be a div with our main navigation, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 373.38,
          "end": 376.76,
          "en": "So from app JS, I'll cut main navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 376.76,
          "end": 378.913,
          "en": "and remove the imports there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 380.02,
          "end": 383.66,
          "en": "And instead, in the layout component, I'll add that here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 383.66,
          "end": 384.61,
          "en": "And therefore, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 384.61,
          "end": 387.59,
          "en": "also add an import of main navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 387.59,
          "end": 390.79,
          "en": "from that main navigation JavaScript file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 390.79,
          "end": 393.003,
          "en": "which is next to the layout file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 394.05,
          "end": 398.95,
          "en": "And below that, we could use the regular main HTML element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 398.95,
          "end": 403.277,
          "en": "and then use the layout component such that we wrap it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 403.277,
          "end": 407.39,
          "en": "around the actual JSX code that should be rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 407.39,
          "end": 410.13,
          "en": "So we could say that in app JS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 410.13,
          "end": 413.72,
          "en": "we want to wrap the content selected and rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 413.72,
          "end": 416.08299999999997,
          "en": "by the router with our layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 417.42,
          "end": 420.01,
          "en": "So here in app JS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 420.01,
          "end": 424.547,
          "en": "we can import layout from going up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 424.547,
          "end": 429.547,
          "en": "diving into the components folder layout, layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 430.82,
          "end": 434.111,
          "en": "And instead of having this useless wrapping div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 434.111,
          "end": 438.57,
          "en": "we could use our own layout component for wrapping here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 438.57,
          "end": 442.18,
          "en": "And now this content here, the actual route contents,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 442.18,
          "end": 445.16,
          "en": "the page component that is being loaded,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 445.16,
          "end": 448.62,
          "en": "should be rendered inside of this main block.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
